{
  "design": "The verification queue of the main pipeline (high-risk units of uncertified stratum-folds) ordered within each campus-quarter by the evidence gap R(1-S), by R, by R times the stratum's mean next-quarter labour per high-burden quarter on the other campuses, and at random; reported as the share of next-quarter high-burden outcomes and labour hours in the first 25, 50 and 75% of each campus-quarter queue, pooled, with fractional positions.",
  "definitions": {
    "queue": "R_quarter >= 0.90 and fold certificate S < 0.67 (missing certificate = 0)",
    "positions": "unit at rank r of n covers [r/n, (r+1)/n); weight in the first f is the covered share below f; tied keys share positions; random order gives expected weight f to every unit",
    "consequence_weight": "mean upm_labour_next over the other campuses' rows of the stratum labelled high burden with the fold-j thresholds; the all-strata mean where the stratum has none",
    "random": "mean of 200 uniform shuffles, with the 2.5-97.5 percentile range",
    "ceiling_realized_labour": "ordering by the realized next-quarter labour; not a decision rule, the most any ordering could place early",
    "conveying_within_full_queue": "positions from the full queue, outcome sums over conveying units only",
    "conveying_queue_alone": "conveying units only, ordered among themselves; S and the weight are constant within a campus, so gap, risk and consequence give one order"
